T-1 — self-telemetry: /metrics and /healthz
===========================================

Run:    2026-08-18
Drill:  bench/drill-t1.sh
Server: TimeLakeDB deploy/compose/timelakedb.yml (plaintext, single node)
Agent:  tributary release build, `[telemetry] addr = "127.0.0.1:9109"`
Where:  a debian:trixie-slim container on the compose network, with the
        Docker socket mounted so the drill can stage a real outage

T-1 was the sole remaining v0.2-pilot gap: "unwatchable shippers don't
survive ops review; every competitor has it; prerequisite for the L5
DaemonSet".

